Author: klc <m_kilic@outlook.com.tr>
Date:   Wed Nov 11 00:10:50 2026 +0300

    fix(input): clipboard read opt-in, readOnly, modifyOtherKeys, IME, zmodem
    
    - TerminalView no longer answers OSC 52 clipboard reads by default;
      embedders that want them set Terminal.onClipboardQuery.
    - readOnly blocks hardware keyboard input and paste; copy and select-all
      still work.
    - modifyOtherKeys level 2 sends unmodified and Shift-only printable keys
      as plain text, and encodes Meta, as xterm does.
    - Cancelling an IME composition no longer sends a backspace.
    - Output that only looks like a ZModem start no longer freezes the
      session; the bytes are shown and input keeps working.
    - Remove a leftover debug main() from the default keytab.
    
    Co-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.2 <noreply@anthropic.com>

