Author: klc <m_kilic@outlook.com.tr>
Date:   Thu Aug 6 22:06:06 2026 +0300

    chore: rename package from xterm2 to xterm3
    
    The code has diverged far enough from the xterm2 line — renderer, buffer
    and reflow, input and search — that it continues under its own name and
    its own repository at klc/xterm3.
    
    The rename is mechanical: the package name, every `package:xterm2/...`
    import, the `XTERM2_FUZZ_ROUNDS` env var, and the repository metadata and
    documentation links. The public API is unchanged, and the entry point
    keeps its name, so consumers change the dependency and the package in
    their imports and nothing else. Version goes to 6.0.0 to signal the
    break.
    
    Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>

