    fix(kitty): follow the protocol's reporting rules for releases and modifiers
    
    Three deviations from the kitty keyboard protocol made a single keystroke
    look like two key events to clients that enable it (observed with omp,
    which pushes flags 5):
    
    - Release events were reported for text-producing keys whenever "report
      event types" was set. The spec reports releases only for keys already
