    perf(rendering): key the glyph cache on packed color values
    
    The paragraph cache key embedded two `Color` instances. A `Color` hashes
    its four floating point components plus its color space, and the key is
    constructed and hashed once per visible cell per frame - 926 times per
    frame on a typical 80x24 screen.
    
